  "description": "LaSalle College Vancouver is a boutique-design school offering applied arts programs that help graduates build rewarding, lifelong careers. We offer Vancouver’s quickest and most affordable Associate of Arts degree. We provide an on-the-job learning experience with a 50/50 classroom-to-lab or studio-split and cross-program collaboration, so students emerge ready for real-world success. Our Game Design program have been ranked #1 school in Canada for 10 years in a row. As part of an international education network, our graduates are hired by industry-leading organizations worldwide. With small class sizes &amp; award-winning instructors, LaSalle College Vancouver is a place where creative dreams come to life. Timestamps Updated",
